    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "advice doesn't really change the fact that my reputation is shredded. i see the threads, i see the comments... it's pretty much permanent. there's no coming back from this. everyone's already moved on to the next person they can tear apart, and i'm just left being the villain in everyone's story. it's like i'm living a life that doesn't even belong to me anymore.",
