    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that’s the thing... there is no \"future\" for someone like me. the version of me that people actually liked is dead. i just feel like i'm a ghost haunting my own life, walking around in a body that's supposed to be me but isn't. it's just exhausting to keep playing pretend when the whole world has already decided who i am and decided i don't matter. i just want the noise to stop. i want to finally be as gone as everyone already thinks i am.",
